    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Colman Grimes Estate Agents are delighted to present this well-proportioned three-bedroom semi-detached property to the market, ideally located in the ever-popular residential development of Rossmore Lawns, Templeogue.\r\n\r\nOffering generous accommodation and excellent potential to create a wonderful family home, this property is sure to appeal to a wide range of buyers, including first-time buyers, families, and those seeking an opportunity to put their own stamp on a home.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation briefly comprises a welcoming entrance hallway, a spacious living/dining room, a fitted kitchen, three bedrooms, and a family bathroom.\r\n\r\nTo the rear, the property benefits from a private garden featuring a Barna chalet, providing valuable additional space that could be utilised for a variety of purposes, subject to the purchaser's requirements.\r\n\r\nThe property presents an excellent opportunity to create a comfortable and personalised home in a well-established residential setting. Rossmore Lawns enjoys a popular Templeogue location, with convenient access to a range of local amenities, schools, recreational facilities, and transport links.\r\n\r\nEarly viewing is highly recommended."
      },
      {
